"`0c40f4832 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/0c40f4832>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.0.rst:110
msgid "Sensor errors now raise ``RuntimeError`` *(behavior)*"
msgstr "传感器错误现在抛出 ``RuntimeError`` *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.0.rst:112
msgid ""
"Sensor error reporting was standardized around a unified error-code table: "
"camera failures (capture timeout, invalid framesize/pixformat/window/ "
"framerate, framebuffer error, JPEG overflow, undetected sensor, ...) now "
"raise consistent, descriptive messages, and several conditions that "
"previously raised ``ValueError`` now raise ``RuntimeError`` (including "
":func:`sensor.reset`). Code that caught ``ValueError`` for these cases must "
"catch ``RuntimeError`` instead."
msgstr ""
"传感器错误报告围绕一张统一的错误码表进行了标准化：摄像头故障（捕获超时、无效的 "
"framesize/pixformat/window/framerate、帧缓冲区错误、JPEG "
"溢出、未检测到传感器等）现在会抛出一致且具描述性的消息，且若干之前抛出 ``ValueError`` 的情形现在改为抛出 "
"``RuntimeError``\\ （包括 :func:`sensor.reset`\\ ）。对于这些情形捕获 ``ValueError`` "
"的代码必须改为捕获 ``RuntimeError``\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.0.rst:120
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `0491a6a88 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/0491a6a88>`__, `c8bf0af6f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/c8bf0af6f>`__, `2fb226562 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/2fb226562>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `0491a6a88 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/0491a6a88>`__\\ "
"、\\ `c8bf0af6f <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/c8bf0af6f>`__\\ 、\\ "
"`2fb226562 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/2fb226562>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.0.rst:127
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "迁移检查清单"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.0.rst:129
msgid "For a clean port to v4.1.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "要干净地移植到 v4.1.0，通常的工作是："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.0.rst:131
msgid ""
"Port NINA/RP2 WiFi code to the standard :class:`network.WLAN` interface "
"(``WLAN(interface)``, ``active()``, ``essid=``) and expect a tuple from "
"``nina.fw_version()`` (:ref:`the WiFi API change <v4_1_0_wifi>`)."
msgstr ""
"将 NINA/RP2 WiFi 代码移植到标准的 :class:`network.WLAN` 接口（\\ ``WLAN(interface)``\\ "
"、\\ ``active()``\\ 、\\ ``essid=``\\ ），并预期 ``nina.fw_version()`` 返回一个元组（\\ "
":ref:`WiFi API 变更 <v4_1_0_wifi>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.0.rst:134
msgid ""
"Change ``except ValueError`` to ``except RuntimeError`` around camera / "
":func:`sensor.reset` error handling (:ref:`the sensor-error change "
"<v4_1_0_errors>`)."
msgstr ""
"在摄像头 / :func:`sensor.reset` 错误处理中，将 ``except ValueError`` 改为 ``except "
"RuntimeError``\\ （\\ :ref:`传感器错误变更 <v4_1_0_errors>`\\ ）。"
